{% doc %}
  @prompt
    **'Create a customer testimonial section with a clean, modern design. Use a light grey or off-white background for the entire section. Add a main heading at the top center that says 'What Our Customers Say...!.
    Below the heading, create three equal-sized cards (columns) side-by-side. Each card should have:
    1. Rounded corners (border-radius) and a very subtle light-blue background.
    2. Five yellow/gold stars centered at the top.
    3. A small purple quote icon in the top-right corner of each card.
    4. A bold sub-heading for the review title (e.g.,
    'Very Helpful For Daily Support').
    5. A paragraph for the review text in a smaller, lighter font.
    6. The customer's name at the very bottom in bold (e.g., 'Marcus R.').
    
    Make sure the layout is responsive (stacks vertically on mobile) and has generous padding between the cards."**, **"Adjust the style of the testimonial section.
    Replace the current flat card design with a more distinctive, rounded bubble-like card shape with substantial border-radius (corners), as seen in reference image image_10.png.
    Card Backgound & Border: Ensure each card has a prominent, light off-white (or light grey) background color and a thin, consistent border matching image_10.png. The section background should be a slightly darker light-grey/off-white to create contrast and a layered effect.
    Quote Icon: Replace the simple purple quotes with a distinct purple circular icon containing white quotes, positioned outside or at the very top edge of the card boundary on the top right.
    Text & Stars: Center-align all elements within the card (stars, review title, review text, and customer name). Use a bold weight for the review titles.
    Adjust the colors: Stars to a clear yellow/gold, titles to a dark bold blue/black, and names to bold blue/
    black."**, "Move the purple circular quote icons so they are placed DIRECTLY INSIDE the top-right corner of each testimonial card, matching the placement shown in image_12.png. They should not be floating above the cards. Ensure the cards have significant rounded corners (border-radius) and that all content (stars, text, name) remains centered within the card. Adjust the card background to be a solid light off-white, and ensure the section background is a slightly darker light grey to create the layered effect seen in image_12.png.", reduce margin bottom of customer name
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_horizontal }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-testimonials-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.heading_margin_bottom }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
  }

  .ai-testimonials-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap }}px;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_content_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-testimonial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    border: {{ block.settings.card_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_content_gap }}px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-testimonial-quote-circle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: {{ block.settings.quote_position_offset }}px;
    right: {{ block.settings.quote_position_offset }}px;
    width: {{ block.settings.quote_circle_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.quote_circle_size }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.quote_circle_bg }};
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .ai-testimonial-quote-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.quote_icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.quote_icon_size }}px;
    fill: {{ block.settings.quote_icon_color }};
  }

  .ai-testimonial-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .ai-testimonial-star-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.star_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.star_size }}px;
    fill: {{ block.settings.star_color }};
  }

  .ai-testimonial-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-testimonial-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-testimonial-name-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.name_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.name_color }};
    margin: 0 0 -{{ block.settings.name_margin_bottom }}px 0;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-testimonials-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-testimonials-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ai-testimonials-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.heading_size }}px * 0.8);
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}
{% if request.page_type == 'page' and handle == 'listicle-1' %}
<customer-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
    <h2 class="ai-testimonials-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="ai-testimonials-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% for i in (1..3) %}
      {% liquid
        assign title_key = 'testimonial_' | append: i | append: '_title'
        assign text_key = 'testimonial_' | append: i | append: '_text'
        assign name_key = 'testimonial_' | append: i | append: '_name'
        
        assign title = block.settings[title_key]
        assign text = block.settings[text_key]
        assign name = block.settings[name_key]
      %}

      <div class="ai-testimonial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-testimonial-quote-circle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <svg class="ai-testimonial-quote-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M6 17h3l2-4V7H5v6h3zm8 0h3l2-4V7h-6v6h3z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="ai-testimonial-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% for star in (1..5) %}
            <svg class="ai-testimonial-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M12 17.27L18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/>
            </svg>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>

        {% if title != blank %}
          <h3 class="ai-testimonial-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ title }}</h3>
        {% endif %}

        {% if text != blank %}
          <p class="ai-testimonial-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ text }}</p>
        {% endif %}

        {% if name != blank %}
          <p class="ai-testimonial-name-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ name }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</customer-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class CustomerTestimonials{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
      }
    }

    customElements.define('customer-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}', CustomerTestimonials{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>
{% endif %}
